    "resource" : {
      "resourceType" : "ValueSet",
      "text" : {
        "status" : "generated",
        "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"/><div style=\"border: black 1px dotted; background-color: #EEEEEE; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px\"><p>Expansion performed internally based on:</p><ul><li><a href=\"http://fhir.kl.dk/term/2.3.0/CodeSystem-CareSocialCodes.html\">codesystem CareSocialCodes v2.3.0 (CodeSystem)</a></li><li><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-ActCode.html\">codesystem ActCode v9.0.0 (CodeSystem)</a></li></ul></div><p>This value set contains 4 concepts</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>System</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode-AMB\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-ActCode.html#v3-ActCode-AMB\">AMB</a></td><td>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode</td><td>ambulatory</td><td><div><p>A comprehensive term for health care provided in a healthcare facility (e.g. a practitioneraTMs office, clinic setting, or hospital) on a nonresident basis. The term ambulatory usually implies that the patient has come to the location and is not assigned to a bed. Sometimes referred to as an outpatient encounter.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode-HH\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-ActCode.html#v3-ActCode-HH\">HH</a></td><td>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode</td><td>home health</td><td><div><p>Healthcare encounter that takes place in the residence of the patient or a designee</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://fhir.kl.dk/term/CodeSystem/CareSocialCodes-1b55a4b0-1156-4f58-b2df-b5c6014d9048\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://fhir.kl.dk/term/2.3.0/CodeSystem-CareSocialCodes.html#CareSocialCodes-1b55a4b0-1156-4f58-b2df-b5c6014d9048\">1b55a4b0-1156-4f58-b2df-b5c6014d9048</a></td><td>http://fhir.kl.dk/term/CodeSystem/CareSocialCodes</td><td>Telefonisk</td><td><div><p>Kontakten er foregået per telefon.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://fhir.kl.dk/term/CodeSystem/CareSocialCodes-124be95d-6924-4609-9d2a-e7c73ae3ab3d\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"http://fhir.kl.dk/term/2.3.0/CodeSystem-CareSocialCodes.html#CareSocialCodes-124be95d-6924-4609-9d2a-e7c73ae3ab3d\">124be95d-6924-4609-9d2a-e7c73ae3ab3d</a></td><td>http://fhir.kl.dk/term/CodeSystem/CareSocialCodes</td><td>Skærmbesøg</td><td><div><p>Kontakten er foregået via skærm med mulighed for tændt kamera, så parterne har haft mulighed for at interagere ansigt til ansigt, og fremvise ting.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div>"
